        <mxCell id="card-legend-notes" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;Large dashed frame: infra perimeter · small: functional group&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⚠ Gx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: docs and code disagree, see &quot;Gaps&quot;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1910" width="600" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-steps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#34d399&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · a failing app becomes a Discord message&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; vmagent scrapes Envoy, kubelet, kube-state-metrics and annotated pods every 30 s, and forces the namespace label.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; It remote_writes to VMSingle :8428: 30 days, under 150k series after the diet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; vmalert evaluates platform rules and the VMRules the CMP writes per project, each group pinned to the project&amp;#39;s namespaces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;4&lt;/span&gt; It sends firing alerts to Alertmanager :9093, which groups them and picks the app webhook, else the project&amp;#39;s, else the platform&amp;#39;s.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#f8fafc;color:#020617;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;5&lt;/span&gt; One Discord message per group: value, runbook, portal link, @here when critical.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="720" y="1540" width="700" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-bg" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb923c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; vlagent tails pod logs and the k3s audit.log, and inserts into VictoriaLogs :9428 (30 days, disk cap).&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt; Template apps expose /metrics and send OTLP spans; the AI landing zone sends GenAI spans. The collector matches the pod from the connection, strips client k8s.* attributes and PII, and exports to VictoriaTraces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;G&lt;/span&gt; to &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;N&lt;/span&gt; Reads: project Grafana orgs go through vmauth (one user per project, read paths only, filters forced). Org 1, the CMP and Argo Rollouts read the stores directly, behind NetworkPolicies, so a vmauth outage never aborts a canary.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;O&lt;/span&gt; vmalert runs log rules on VictoriaLogs. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;P&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;Q&lt;/span&gt; The CMP mutes alerts (project matcher forced) and posts its own events in the same format.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;R&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;S&lt;/span&gt; A Watchdog alert pings the dead man&amp;#39;s switch every 5 min; silence for 15 min means the alert chain is down.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt; vmbackup copies metrics to Ceph RGW daily. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #f8fafc;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;V&lt;/span&gt; audit-record reads each finished agent run, signs it with Vault transit, and puts it under Object Lock for 180 days.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1460" y="1540" width="1000" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-replaces" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#fb7185&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;What goes away&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Alloy&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (1.8 GiB on two nodes) → vmagent + vlagent.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Loki&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; + nginx gateway + per-project tenants → VictoriaLogs + vmauth filters.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;VM cluster&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; (vminsert, vmselect, vmstorage) → VMSingle; the old Service names stay as aliases, so rollback is a selector flip.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#f8fafc&quot;&gt;Grafana-managed project alerts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, the Loki ruler → vmalert. Custom Grafana rules of projects stay.&lt;br&gt;• Tempo, planned by the AI landing zone, is not installed: it stays the fallback for VictoriaTraces (pre-1.0).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#0b1222;strokeColor=#1e293b;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#e2e8f0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2500" y="1540" width="580" height="420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
